      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://beckdc.com/historical-places-in-lakeland-south/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Lakeland South’s development is part of the broader suburban growth around Tacoma, reflecting mid‑20th‑century expansion.",
